        {
          "text": "Eng’ lagokab Juda, ibinwekwak, ko u ortinwekwak, ko u gorikab kwanisiekwak, ko u ole te kainaik, koboch che bo kenyisiek tiptem ak kwo tai, tugul che kiimuchi koba luget. ",
